@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #374151
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.3
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam component {
  BorderColor #1F2937
  FontColor #111827
}
skinparam interface {
  BorderColor #1F2937
  FontColor #111827
}
skinparam note {
  BorderColor #1F2937
  FontColor #111827
}

title Theory combination: bounded search versus exact shared-universe decision

component "theory A\nConstraintTheory" as A #DBEAFE
component "theory B\nConstraintTheory" as B #DBEAFE
component "A <+> B\nbounded fair joint search" as BoundedJoin #FEF3C7
interface "combined RejectSafeAlgebra\nSat | Unsat | DontKnow" as RejectSafe #FEF3C7

A -down-> BoundedJoin : factor
B -down-> BoundedJoin : factor
BoundedJoin -down-> RejectSafe : always sound

note right of BoundedJoin
  A checked shared assignment proves Sat.
  Bounded failure to find one yields DontKnow,
  not classical Unsat.
end note

component "complete shared universe D\nenum_all : every d is enumerated" as Universe #DCFCE7
component "combined DecidableConstraintTheory\ndecide_exact by exhaustive joint search" as ExactJoin #DCFCE7
interface "combined BooleanAlgebra" as Boolean #CCFBF1

A -right-> ExactJoin : decidable atom evaluation
B -left-> ExactJoin : decidable atom evaluation
Universe -down-> ExactJoin : completeness witness
ExactJoin -down-> Boolean : exact upgrade

note right of ExactJoin
  This is the exact enumerable base case proved in
  TheoryCombination.v. Full Nelson–Oppen combination
  over infinite domains requires its stronger hypotheses
  and is not inferred from a search bound.
end note

component "TheoryCombination.v\ncsat_sound · csat_complete\ncombined_eba_laws" as Formal #E0E7FF
ExactJoin ..> Formal : mechanized proof

legend right
|= Color |= Role |
|<#DBEAFE> | general component theory (blue) |
|<#FEF3C7> | bounded reject-safe combination (amber) |
|<#DCFCE7> | explicit completeness evidence and exact decision (green) |
|<#CCFBF1> | resulting classical algebra (teal) |
|<#E0E7FF> | Rocq proof (indigo) |
endlegend
@enduml
